### Step 1 - 로그 한 건 발행
POST http://localhost:8080/api/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "service": "order-api",
  "level": "ERROR",
  "message": "NullPointerException at OrderService.create",
  "host": "host-a"
}

### Step 1 - 무작위 로그 1000건 발행
POST http://localhost:8080/api/logs/generate?count=1000

### Step 1 - 소비 건수 확인
GET http://localhost:8080/api/logs/stats

### Actuator health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
